2. Piano Fingering Dataset (PIG) Academic Citation & Provenance Notice
   The upstream `@lumikey/piano-fingering-model` weights were trained on a mixture of datasets
   that includes preprocessed data from the PIG dataset:
     Eita Nakamura, Yasuyuki Saito, and Kazuyoshi Yoshii,
     "Statistical Learning and Estimation of Piano Fingering",
     Information Sciences, Vol. 517, pp. 68-85, 2020.
   Note: The PIG dataset itself is restricted to nonprofit/academic use and is NOT bundled or
   redistributed in this repository. Because upstream has not formally clarified whether the
   derived model weights are subject to PIG dataset terms, the pretrained prior can be disabled
   or unbundled at build time via `VITE_BUNDLE_PRIOR=0` (or pointed to a user-supplied model URL).
   See `docs/adr/0003-pretrained-fingering-prior.md` for details.
